  "description": "Experience Clusterduck - free to acquire and simple to set up. Completely secure with no viruses or malware. Always easy to get the latest version.",
  "editor_review": "🐣 Step into the world of CLUSTERDUCK, the quirky and engaging game where you hatch and transform ducks like never before! Can you manage the mayhem as these ducks become completely wild? Dive into numerous head, wing, and body variations to craft amazing and amusing duck hybrids. But be cautious, as each generation raises the chances of unexpected mishaps! Send ducks down *the hole* to create space, but be wary of what might be waiting! With clever duck profiles and mysteries to find, CLUSTERDUCK promises hours of fun.",
  "how_to_play": [
    "🦆 Hatch and evolve countless ducks",
    "🦾 Gather hundreds of funny and distinct duck varieties",
    "🔬 Mutations vary in rarity, from common to mythical",
    "📜 Read entertaining duck profiles to learn about their personalities",
    "🕳️ Uncover the mysteries of *the hole* as you explore deeper"
